    "text": "Riviera\nReport Card Surprise: Riviera ISD Jumps to a B, High School Stays an A\n1 hours ago\nCORPUS CHRISTI, Texas — Riviera ISD just scored big on the state’s latest report card and district leaders say it’s proof their students are putting in the work. The Texas Education Agency raised the district’s overall grade from a C to a B. Riviera Elementary earned a B, the middle school also landed a B, and the high school? Straight A’s... same as last year.",
